          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganna kud'ani shaneeso ka Kaisari Tiberioni lafa fide, gaafa Pontio Pilatoni lafa Yahudi fide, ka Herodeni hayyu Galilaya, ka oboleesi isaa Filiponi hayyu lafa Itureafi Trakoniti, Lisanialeeni hayyu lafa Abilene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaafa Anasifi Kayafani qaalole gugurdo tahani, gaafasi dubbini Waaqa lafa alooti Yohana ilma Zekariati d'ufte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi inni lafa ch'ufa ta d'aawatu galaana Yordani d'aqe namati odeese waan jed'e, Daba iraa deebia, batifama, aka daba isani araaramani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.40.3+ISA.40.4+ISA.40.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 40.3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuma kitaaba raaga Isaya keesati t'aafani:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
